title square screen: Cassette: a choice row opens its picker in the same list (the chosen entry darker); a tap takes a value; a switch row flips
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key s
wait 300
tap "Record timer"
wait 300
expect text "10 s"
expect text "20 s"
shot picker
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "10 s"
wait 300
expect text "Record timer"
expect text "10 s"
say the picker set the record timer (setting_choice timer 2)
tap "Auto gain (card)"
wait 300
say the switch row flipped (setting_toggle agc off)
shot settings-after
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
